Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 81

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart P008.1

Summary: Independent learning, held controls, checkpoint heading diagnostics

Description: |
    Collie Kart P008.1 experimental independent learner for MK7 USA Rev2.
    Holds native steering decisions for approximately 390ms while
    observing every 65ms and maintaining the command watchdog.
    Adds read-only checkpoint index and heading diagnostics.
    Next-checkpoint target bearing is NOT yet available to the policy.
    Offline supervised Time Trial testing only; physical override enabled.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
